    "accessibility": {
      "short": "Five figures including a woman holding a baby, a bearded man, a standing child, an older woman, and a lamb, with a basket nearby.",
      "long": "A richly colored oil painting depicts five human figures and a lamb in an interior setting. At center, a woman in a vivid red gown with blue sleeves sits and holds a nude infant close to her chest; her gaze is directed downward at the child. To her left, a bearded man in grey drapery leans in, his hand near a second nude child who stands barefoot, wearing a white wrap and sandals, looking toward the woman. To the right, an older woman with a white head covering sits observing the group, hands folded. A woven basket containing cloth rests on the floor beside her, and a small lamb is partially visible near the standing child’s feet. The background includes a dark interior wall and a glimpse of sky or water through an opening.",
